---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Healthcare — Fusionedge">
<div class="ix">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-hero">
    <span class="ix-kick">Facility and asset software for healthcare</span>
    <h1><span>Patient care depends on</span><span class="ix-c">a hospital that never stops.</span></h1>
    <p class="ix-lead">Oxygen plants, OT air handling, DG sets and hundreds of biomedical devices have to work every hour. FusionEdge keeps every asset maintained, every area cleaned on time, and every audit backed by proof.</p>
    <div class="ix-btns">
      <a class="ix-btn pri" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a demo</a>
      <a class="ix-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to our team</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-trust"><span><b>All 26 apps</b> in one plan</span><span>Photo and time-stamp proof</span><span>No card needed</span></div>
    <div class="ix-stage">
      <div class="ix-app" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a FusionEdge Healthcare dashboard">
        <div class="ix-chrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="u">app.fusionedge.io/compliance</span></div>
        <div class="ix-scroll"><div class="ix-ui">
          <div class="ix-side"><span class="">Overview</span><span class="on">Compliance</span><span class="">Biomedical</span><span class="">Work orders</span><span class="">Checklists</span><span class="">Reports</span></div>
          <div class="db"><div class="db-h"><div><b>Compliance · Main campus</b><small>Cleaning and infection-control rounds, this week</small></div><div class="sp"><span class="db-pill">All wards ▾</span><span class="db-pill">This week</span><span class="db-btn">Export audit</span></div></div><div class="db-k"><div><small>Rounds done</small><strong>98%</strong><em class="">▲ 2% vs last week</em></div><div><small>Photo proof</small><strong>100%</strong><em class="">every closed round</em></div><div><small>Calibration due</small><strong>6</strong><em class="w">next 30 days</em></div><div><small>Overdue</small><strong>1</strong><em class="r">Ventilator V-11</em></div></div><div class="db-row" style="grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr"><div class="db-pn"><div class="db-pt"><b>Cleaning compliance by area</b><span>% of rounds done on time</span></div><div class="db-heat"><span></span><span style="text-align:center">M</span><span style="text-align:center">T</span><span style="text-align:center">W</span><span style="text-align:center">T</span><span style="text-align:center">F</span><span style="text-align:center">S</span><span style="text-align:center">S</span><span>ICU-3</span><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">96</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">92</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><span>OT complex</span><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#e8a23a">88</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><span>Ward 5B</span><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">92</i><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">96</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#e8a23a">84</i><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">96</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><span>Emergency</span><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">96</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">96</i><span>Radiology</span><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:rgba(0,191,136,.55)">92</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i><i style="background:#00BF88">100</i></div></div><div class="db-pn"><div class="db-pt"><b>Biomedical calibration</b><span>Soonest first</span></div><div class="db-tb"><div style="grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr .8fr"><span>Device</span><span>Area</span><span>Calibration</span></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr .8fr"><b>Infusion pump IP-22</b><span>Ward 5B</span><i class="db-st w">7 days</i></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr .8fr"><b>Defibrillator D-04</b><span>Emergency</span><i class="db-st p">12 days</i></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr .8fr"><b>Ventilator V-11</b><span>ICU-3</span><i class="db-st r">Overdue</i></div><div style="grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr .8fr"><b>Patient monitor PM-30</b><span>OT-2</span><i class="db-st p">21 days</i></div></div></div></div></div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="ix-re"><div><b>All 26 apps in one plan</b><p>From asset management to visitor management, with no hidden add-ons.</p></div><div><b>No card, no setup fee</b><p>Book a demo and see it working on your own sites and assets.</p></div><div><b>ISO 27001:2022 certified</b><p>AES-256 encryption, two-factor login and role-based access.</p></div><div><b>Web, mobile and QR</b><p>Technicians work on their phones. Anyone can report an issue by QR.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <hr class="ix-rule">

  <!-- Segments -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-sec">
    <div class="ix-head">
      <div><h2>Which kind of care setting is yours?</h2><p class="ix-p">A 500-bed hospital and a chain of clinics face different pressures. FusionEdge fits the way each one runs.</p></div>
      <a class="ix-link" href="/industries/">All industries →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-segs"><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519494026892-80bbd2d6fd0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Hospital lobby reception" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Hospitals</h3><p>Multi-speciality and teaching</p><small><b>Fits</b> · OTs, ICUs, utilities</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762625570087-6d98fca29531?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762625570087-6d98fca29531?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1762625570087-6d98fca29531?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Modern clinic waiting room" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Clinic chains</h3><p>Many small sites</p><small><b>Fits</b> · one standard everywhere</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606206591513-adbfbdd7a177?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606206591513-adbfbdd7a177?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606206591513-adbfbdd7a177?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Blood collection tubes in a laboratory rack" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Diagnostics and labs</h3><p>Imaging and pathology</p><small><b>Fits</b> · calibration and AMCs</small></article><article class="ix-seg"><div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773227055624-07b515ba87c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773227055624-07b515ba87c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773227055624-07b515ba87c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Caregiver helping an elderly woman with a walker" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div><h3>Senior care</h3><p>Residences and care homes</p><small><b>Fits</b> · cleaning and safety</small></article></div>

    <!-- Feature photo -->
    <div class="ix-feat">
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516549655169-df83a0774514?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516549655169-df83a0774514?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516549655169-df83a0774514?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2800&q=60 2x" alt="Operating room with surgical lights and equipment" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div class="ix-feat-card"><h2>Audit-ready on any day, not just audit day</h2><p class="ix-p">Every device carries its service history, warranty, AMC and calibration dates, and every checklist is closed with a photo and time stamp.</p><a class="ix-link" href="/industries/healthcare#faq-0">See audit records →</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it runs -->
  <section class="ix-runs">
    <div class="ix-w ix-runs-g">
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584820927498-cfe5211fd8bf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584820927498-cfe5211fd8bf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584820927498-cfe5211fd8bf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=60 2x" alt="Person putting on blue medical gloves" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div>
        <h2>How a hospital week runs</h2>
        <p class="ix-p">The same five jobs every week, now in one place and in the order they happen.</p>
        <div class="ix-rows"><div class="ix-row"><b>Prepare</b><p>OT air handling, medical gases and equipment are checked before every list.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Clean</b><p>Ward, ICU and OT cleaning rounds are logged with a photo and time stamp.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Maintain</b><p>Biomedical devices and plant rooms are serviced on schedule, with calibration due dates tracked.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Respond</b><p>Faults become tickets, and critical ones are escalated at once.</p></div><div class="ix-row"><b>Prove</b><p>Audit reports are exported by area, asset or date range in a few clicks.</p></div></div>
        <div class="ix-btns"><a class="ix-btn dark" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">See the platform</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Side by side -->
  <section class="ix-w ix-sec ix-sbs">
    <div>
      <h2>Two weeks, side by side</h2>
      <p class="ix-p">Same hospital, same wards, same audit next month. The difference is how much proof you have.</p>
      <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512678080530-7760d81faba6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512678080530-7760d81faba6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512678080530-7760d81faba6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=60 2x" alt="Hospital bed in a patient room" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ix-tbl"><div class="th"></div><div class="th">A week on paper</div><div class="th hi">A week with FusionEdge</div><div class="d">Monday</div><div class="o">Cleaning logs are signed on a sheet by the door.</div><div class="n">Rounds are closed on the phone with a photo.</div><div class="d">Tuesday</div><div class="o">An infusion pump’s calibration date is unknown.</div><div class="n">Calibration is due in 7 days, and the team is reminded.</div><div class="d">Wednesday</div><div class="o">Oxygen plant readings are written in a register.</div><div class="n">Readings are logged at set times, with drops flagged.</div><div class="d">Thursday</div><div class="o">OT-2 pressure drops. Calls go to three people.</div><div class="n">A critical ticket alerts the right engineer at once.</div><div class="d">Friday</div><div class="o">The MRI chiller service report is emailed and lost.</div><div class="n">The report is stored on the chiller’s record.</div><div class="d">Saturday</div><div class="o">Fire drill attendance is on paper.</div><div class="n">The drill is logged with time stamps.</div><div class="d">Sunday</div><div class="o">Audit prep means days of digging through files.</div><div class="n">Every record is already in one place.</div></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Customer story -->
  <section class="ix-story">
    <div class="ix-w">
      <h2>14 campuses, one way of working</h2>
      <p class="ix-p">How a fast-growing co-working operator put every campus on the same processes in 10 weeks.</p>
      <div class="ix-card">
        <div class="ix-ph"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772723822651-d2161754d61b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70" srcset="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772723822651-d2161754d61b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70 1x, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1772723822651-d2161754d61b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=60 2x" alt="Co-working space interior with sofa and plants" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
        <div class="ix-cb">
          <span class="who">Facility Operations, Readings &amp; Logs, PPM</span>
          <p class="sum">A fast-growing co-working operator had no clear view of what was happening across its campuses. FusionEdge gave every campus the same processes and tracked 32,000+ assets.</p>
          <div class="ix-stats"><div><b>96%</b><span>PPM done on time, up from 52%</span></div><div><b>−45%</b><span>unplanned breakdowns</span></div><div><b>5 days</b><span>to set up a new campus, down from 3 weeks</span></div></div>
          <blockquote>“Every task is closed with a photo and time stamp, so service quality can be proven to tenants.”</blockquote>
          <div class="ix-btns"><a class="ix-btn dark" href="/stories/facility-operations">Read the story</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ix-also"><b>Also running on FusionEdge:</b><div><span>Multi-speciality hospitals</span><span>Clinic chains</span><span>Diagnostic centres</span><span>Medical colleges</span><span>Senior care</span><span>Day-care surgery centres</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="ix-cta">
    <div class="ix-w">
      <h2>Be audit-ready every day <span>with FusionEdge.</span></h2>
      <p class="ix-p">Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your theatres, wards, plant rooms and front desk. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="ix-btns">
        <a class="ix-btn pri" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="ix-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.ix{--brand:#5D1F72;--ink:#1a1424;--mut:#6b6478;--line:rgba(93,31,114,0.1);--soft:rgba(93,31,114,0.05);--soft2:#f5f5f7;--mint:#eef8f3;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#008a62;
  --w:1080px;--pad:clamp(20px,4vw,40px);--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);
  font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;background:#fff;overflow-x:clip}
.ix *,.ix *::before,.ix *::after{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif}
.ix h1,.ix h2,.ix h3,.ix p{margin:0;max-width:none}
.ix a{color:inherit}
.ix-w{max-width:calc(var(--w) + var(--pad)*2);margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--pad)}
.ix h1{font-size:clamp(19px,4.8vw,58px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.ix h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);text-wrap:balance}
.ix h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}
.ix .ix-c{color:var(--brand)}
.ix .ix-p{font-size:15px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.ix-kick{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);letter-spacing:.01em}
.ix-btns{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.ix a.ix-btn,.ix a.ix-btn:visited{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:99px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none!important;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.18);background:#fff;color:var(--ink)!important;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s,background .15s}
.ix a.ix-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.ix a.ix-btn.pri,.ix a.ix-btn.pri:visited{background:var(--brand);border-color:var(--brand);color:#fff!important}
.ix a.ix-btn.pri:hover{background:var(--brand-d)}
.ix a.ix-btn.dark,.ix a.ix-btn.dark:visited{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff!important}
.ix a.ix-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)!important;text-decoration:none}
.ix a.ix-link:hover{color:var(--brand)!important}
.ix-ph{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px;color:#8d83a0;font-size:12px;text-align:center;padding:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(93,31,114,0.1),#e6f4ee)}
.ix-ph span{max-width:26ch;line-height:1.4;opacity:.85}
.ix-ph img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}

/* Hero */
.ix-hero{text-align:center;padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,88px)}
.ix-hero h1{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:none}
.ix-hero h1 span{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.ix-hero .ix-lead{max-width:540px;margin:20px auto 28px;font-size:16px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.6}
.ix-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:6px 20px;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-trust b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.ix-trust span+span::before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.25);margin:0 14px 2px 0;vertical-align:middle}
.ix-stage{position:relative;margin-top:clamp(36px,5vw,52px)}
.ix-stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-50vw;right:-50vw;top:12%;bottom:0;background:var(--soft);z-index:0}

/* App mock */
.ix-app{position:relative;z-index:1;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.12);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -24px rgba(93,31,114,.25);overflow:hidden;text-align:left}
.ix-chrome{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:34px;padding:0 12px;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.03);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.1)}
.ix-chrome i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.18);display:inline-block}
.ix-chrome .u{margin:0 auto;font-size:10.5px;color:#8d83a0;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.1);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 14px}
.ix-scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
.ix-ui{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);min-width:900px;font-size:11px}
.ix-side{border-right:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.07);padding:14px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.ix-side span{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:7px;color:#4b4357}
.ix-side span.on{background:var(--soft);color:var(--brand);font-weight:600}
.ix-side em{font-style:normal;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#e5483b;border-radius:99px;padding:0 6px}
.ix-main{padding:12px 14px 6px}
.ix-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}
.ix-top b{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink)}
.ix-top small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-tog{display:flex;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.06);border-radius:7px;padding:2px;margin-left:6px}
.ix-tog span{padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;font-size:10px}
.ix-tog span.on{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.ix-prog{margin-left:auto;text-align:right;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-prog b{display:inline;font-size:11px}
.ix-prog em{display:block;width:150px;height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.09);margin-top:4px;overflow:hidden}
.ix-prog em i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--green);border-radius:99px}
.ix-pub{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:10.5px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap}
.ix-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));border-top:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.07)}
.ix-grid>div{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.06);border-left:1px solid rgba(93,31,114,0.06);min-height:46px;padding:5px}
.ix-grid>div:nth-child(8n+1){border-left:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding-left:2px}
.ix-gh{min-height:28px!important;font-size:10px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center}
.ix-gh.today{color:var(--brand)}
.ix-av{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:700;background:rgba(93,31,114,0.08);color:var(--brand)}
.ix-av.op{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed rgba(93,31,114,0.4);color:var(--brand)}
.ix-rn b{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}
.ix-rn small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--mut)}
.ix-ch{display:block;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 6px;line-height:1.25;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600}
.ix-ch small{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:8.5px;opacity:.8}
.ix-ch.ppm{background:rgba(93,31,114,0.08);color:#5D1F72}
.ix-ch.chk{background:#e8f8f1;color:#00754f}
.ix-ch.tkt{background:#fdecea;color:#b23a2b}
.ix-ch.ins{background:#fdf1e2;color:#9a5c0d}
.ix-ch.opn{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed rgba(93,31,114,0.35);color:#5D1F72}
